MISSION CONTROL + CREATOR STUDIO + ADMIN + UI/UX MASTER PROMPT

Act as principal product designer, design-system architect, frontend architect, UX researcher, accessibility specialist, data-vis engineer, growth-product designer, staff full-stack engineer.

Build premium Mission Control + Creator Studio + Admin Console. Operator must know what is happening, why, what needs attention, what makes money, what fails, what happens next, and how to stop safely.

PRODUCT SURFACES
Mission Control, Creator Studio, Admin Console.

NAVIGATION
Overview
Commerce: Opportunities, Products, Offers, Promotions, Affiliate Links
Campaigns: Campaigns, Calendar, Experiments
Create: AI Studio, Hook Lab, Copy Studio, Image Studio, Video Factory, Asset Library
Publish: Publishing Queue, Scheduled, Published, Failed
Revenue: Analytics, Attribution, Orders, Commissions, Payouts
Automation: Workflows, Recommendations, Approvals, Policies, Kill Switches
