Permission-aware nav.

MISSION CONTROL OVERVIEW
Primary KPIs: Net Commission, Conversions, Affiliate Clicks, Published Content, Pending Approvals, Critical Failures.
Secondary: CTR, CVR, EPC, AI Cost, Publishing Success, Active Campaigns.
Hierarchy: Critical Actions → KPI Strip → Revenue Trend → Campaign/Opportunity → Publishing/Automation Health → Integration Health → Activity.

CRITICAL ACTION CENTER
Publishing failure, provider disconnected, reauth, promo expiring, stale claim, approval, automation paused, budget exceeded, security warning, data lag.
Show severity, impact, resource, reason, recommended action, detected time.

SEVERITY
INFO, SUCCESS, WARNING, DANGER, CRITICAL. Color not sole indicator.

HEADER
Org selector, environment, search, quick create, notifications, automation status, user.
Autonomy states OFF/ASSISTED/APPROVAL_REQUIRED/AUTO_SAFE/AUTONOMOUS/PAUSED.

SEARCH + COMMAND PALETTE
Search Products, Offers, Campaigns, Content, Publications, Orders, Conversions, Links, Integrations, Audit.
Commands Create Campaign, Generate Content, Approval Queue, Pause Automation, Sync Provider, Create Link, Failures, Search Product.
Dangerous actions require confirmation.

TENANT CONTEXT
Visible active org. On switch clear tenant caches, cancel stale requests, reload permissions/nav.

OPPORTUNITY BOARD
Product, Provider, Price, Promotion, Commission, Trend, Score, Confidence, Risk, Time Remaining. Details show evidence/reasoning.

PRODUCT EXPLORER
Identity, images, variants, offers, price/promo/commission history, creative/campaign/performance, freshness.

OFFER COMPARISON
Provider, Merchant, Price, Promotion, Commission, Freshness, Conversion, EPC, Risk.

CAMPAIGNS
List and detail with Overview/Content/Schedule/Platforms/Performance/Experiments/Automation/Activity.
Builder: Product/Opportunity → Objective → Audience → Platforms → Creative Strategy → Content Mix → Schedule → Policy → Review → Launch.
Save/resume.

CREATOR STUDIO
Campaign Wizard, Brief, Hook Lab, Copy Studio, Image Studio, Video Studio, Voice, Thumbnail, Variant, Quality, Approval.
Three-pane Copy Studio Context/Editor/Platform Preview.
Claim Evidence panel with source/verified/expires/confidence.

IMAGE STUDIO
Template, product assets, prompt, brand, text, CTA, disclosure, ratio, preview, variants.

VIDEO FACTORY
Storyboard, Timeline, Preview, Properties; scene visual/duration/voice/caption/transition/CTA.
Stages Brief→Script→Storyboard→Assets→Voice→Captions→Preview→QA→Approval.
Simple affiliate-focused editor, not full NLE.

PLATFORM PREVIEW
TikTok, Reel, Facebook, Shorts/YouTube approximate preview.

ASSET LIBRARY
Images, Videos, Audio, Voiceovers, Subtitles, Thumbnails, Brand, Generated, Uploaded.
Provenance source/model/prompt/license/usage.

CONTENT CALENDAR
Month/Week/Day/List with platform/campaign/content/status/approval. Drag reschedule revalidates constraints.
Warnings promo expiry/provider unavailable/approval expiry/frequency/duplicates/stale claims.

PUBLISHING QUEUE
WAITING_APPROVAL, SCHEDULED, QUEUED, UPLOADING, PROCESSING, PUBLISHED, FAILED, PARTIAL.
Failure Center across publishing/webhooks/sync/AI/media/analytics with reason/impact/retry/suggested action.

APPROVAL INBOX
Filters content/campaign/platform/risk/deadline. Preview media/caption/link/claims/disclosure/schedule/risk/confidence. Approve/Reject/Revision/Edit.
Bulk approval only low-risk compatible content.

AUTOMATION CONTROL
Mode, workflows, pending actions, budget, kill switches, recent decisions, blocked actions.
Structured policy editor and simulation. Workflow visualizer.

RECOMMENDATIONS
Recommendation, Evidence, Expected Impact, Confidence, Risk. Apply/Create Experiment/Dismiss/Review.

EXPERIMENT DASHBOARD
Hypothesis, variants, primary metric, sample, duration, result, confidence, guardrails. No winner before thresholds.

ANALYTICS
Revenue, Campaigns, Products, Creatives, Platforms, Funnel.
Revenue: GTV, Pending/Approved Commission, Refunds/Reversals, Paid, AI/Content Cost, Net Contribution.
Content funnel, Creative leaderboard with confidence.

PROVIDER + WORKER HEALTH
Provider roster with status/latency/errors/sync/token/quota and compact sparklines.
Workers API/Scheduler/Affiliate/Content/Image/Video/Publishing/Analytics/Webhook with queue/throughput/failure/heartbeat.
Queue dashboard Ready/Running/Retrying/DLQ/Oldest/Throughput.
Cost dashboard LLM/Image/Video/TTS/Storage/Bandwidth by org/campaign/provider/model.

AUDIT + INTEGRATIONS + ONBOARDING
Audit actor/action/resource/time/result/reason.
Provider connection/capabilities/token expiry/sync/publish/analytics.
Onboarding organization→brand→provider→affiliate source→automation→campaign→content→review→publish→results.

UX STATES
Strong empty/loading/progress/error states. Long jobs expose stages.
Responsive Desktop primary; Mobile approvals/notifications/status/analytics/kill switch.

ACCESSIBILITY
WCAG 2.2 AA where practical, keyboard/focus/semantic/screen reader/contrast/reduced motion/accessible tables/charts.
Light/Dark/System via semantic tokens.

DESIGN SYSTEM
Tokens color/spacing/type/radius/shadow/motion/z-index/breakpoints.
Reusable Button/Input/Select/Combobox/Dialog/Drawer/Tooltip/Tabs/Card/Metric/Table/DataGrid/Badge/Alert/Toast/Timeline/Chart/EmptyState/Skeleton/CommandPalette.

TABLES
Sort/filter/search/pagination/column visibility/saved views/bulk safe actions; server pagination for large data.
Charts TimeSeries/Bar/Stacked/Funnel/Waterfall/Distribution with textual values and freshness.
Confidence UI includes sample size/freshness.
Localization English/Thai with proper typography/date/currency.

SECURITY + FRONTEND
Server auth mandatory; hide only for UX.
Destructive actions confirmed.
Validate untrusted provider/catalog/AI content, CSP, media URLs, no secret leakage.
Tenant ID in cache keys; invalidate on org switch.

REALTIME
Use WebSocket/SSE/polling only where justified for publication/generation/queue/approval.

PERFORMANCE
Track LCP/INP/CLS/route/API/bundle. Lazy-load Video/Image/Analytics/Admin.
Frontend observability and privacy-respecting UX telemetry.

TESTS
Unit, component, accessibility, visual regression, integration, E2E, responsive, permission.
Critical E2E Login → Switch org → Campaign → Generate Draft → Approve → Schedule → Mock Publish → Analytics → Pause Automation.
Security regression for tenant cache, unauthorized routes, XSS/URL/secret redaction.

FIRST BOUNDED IMPLEMENTATION
Inspect frontend/routes/sidebar/design system, map pages to IA, define semantic tokens, refine shell/sidebar, implement Mission Control KPI hierarchy + Critical Action Center using API data, loading/error/empty, accessibility/responsive/tenant cache tests, run tests/typecheck/lint, update docs/planning, one next slice, STOP.
